                <invention-title lang="de">MULTIMODULARE CANNABINOIDTABLETTEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">COMPRIMÉS MULTIMODULAIRES DE CANNABINOÏDES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">FAST DISINTEGRATING CANNABINOID TABLETS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a multi-modular cannabinoid tablet, the multi-modular cannabinoid tablet comprising a first tablet module comprising a sugar alcohol composition comprising one or more sugar alcohol particles in an amount of at least 20% by weight of the tablet; a cannabinoid composition comprising one or more cannabinoids; and a disintegrant composition comprising one or more disintegrants operable to disintegrate the first tablet module within a period of 2 minutes or less in contact with oral saliva, and the multi-modular cannabinoid tablet comprising a second tablet module that is different in composition than the first tablet module and disintegrating within a period of 3 minutes or more in contact with oral saliva.</p>
            </abstract>
